#: ../../source/controllers/toughc5.rst:3
#: ../../source/refs/controllers.toughc5.ref:1
msgid "ToughC5"
msgstr "ToughC5"

#: ../../source/controllers/toughc5.rst:7
msgid "Support the following products:"
msgstr "支持以下产品："

#: ../../source/controllers/toughc5.rst:9
msgid "|ToughC5|"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/controllers/toughc5.rst:12
msgid "Supported Components"
msgstr "支持的组件"

#: ../../source/controllers/toughc5.rst:14
msgid "The ToughC5 firmware includes the following user-facing packages:"
msgstr "ToughC5 固件包含以下面向用户的软件包："

#: ../../source/controllers/toughc5.rst:16
msgid "`M5UI <../m5ui/index.html>`_: The ``m5ui`` LVGL component library."
msgstr "`M5UI <../m5ui/index.html>`_：``m5ui`` LVGL 组件库。"

#: ../../source/controllers/toughc5.rst:17
msgid ""
"`Module <../module/index.html>`_: The ``module`` package for M-BUS "
"expansion modules."
msgstr "`Module <../module/index.html>`_：用于 M-BUS 扩展模块的 ``module`` 软件包。"

#: ../../source/controllers/toughc5.rst:18
msgid ""
"`Unit <../unit/index.html>`_: The ``unit`` package containing Unit "
"drivers."
msgstr "`Unit <../unit/index.html>`_：包含 Unit 驱动的 ``unit`` 软件包。"

#: ../../source/controllers/toughc5.rst:19
msgid "`Chain <../chain/index.html>`_: The ``chain`` package for Chain devices."
msgstr "`Chain <../chain/index.html>`_：用于 Chain 设备的 ``chain`` 软件包。"

#: ../../source/controllers/toughc5.rst:20
msgid "`Hardware <../hardware/index.html>`_: The ``hardware`` package for "
"``Speaker``, ``Touch``, ``SDCard``, and ``PWR485``."
msgstr "`Hardware <../hardware/index.html>`_：用于 ``Speaker``、``Touch``、``SDCard`` 和 ``PWR485`` 的 ``hardware`` 软件包。"

#: ../../source/controllers/toughc5.rst:24
msgid "Supported Display Fonts"
msgstr "支持的显示字体"

#: ../../source/controllers/toughc5.rst:26
msgid ""
"The ToughC5 firmware includes the following Montserrat fonts for LVGL and"
" M5UI: ``lv.font_montserrat_12``, ``lv.font_montserrat_14``, "
"``lv.font_montserrat_16``, ``lv.font_montserrat_18``, "
"``lv.font_montserrat_24``, ``lv.font_montserrat_40``, "
"``lv.font_montserrat_44``, and ``lv.font_montserrat_48``."
msgstr ""
"ToughC5 固件为 LVGL 和 M5UI 提供以下 Montserrat "
"字体：``lv.font_montserrat_12``、``lv.font_montserrat_14``、``lv.font_montserrat_16``、``lv.font_montserrat_18``、``lv.font_montserrat_24``、``lv.font_montserrat_40``、``lv.font_montserrat_44``"
" 和 ``lv.font_montserrat_48``。"

#: ../../source/controllers/toughc5.rst:31
msgid ""
"For ``M5.Lcd.FONTS``, the firmware also provides ``AlibabaPuHuiTiCN24``, "
"``AlibabaSansJA24``, and ``AlibabaSansKR24`` for Chinese, Japanese, and "
"Korean text respectively."
msgstr ""
"对于 ``M5.Lcd.FONTS``，固件还提供 ``AlibabaPuHuiTiCN24``、``AlibabaSansJA24`` 和 "
"``AlibabaSansKR24``，分别用于中文、日文和韩文文本。"

#: ../../source/controllers/toughc5.rst:36
msgid "Board Features"
msgstr "板载功能"

#: ../../source/controllers/toughc5.rst:38
msgid "ToughC5 supports the following built-in functions and peripherals:"
msgstr "ToughC5 支持以下内置功能和外设："

#: ../../source/controllers/toughc5.rst:40
msgid "ESP32-C5 microcontroller."
msgstr "ESP32-C5 微控制器。"

#: ../../source/controllers/toughc5.rst:41
msgid "320 x 240 ILI9342 color LCD output through ``M5.Display``."
msgstr "通过 ``M5.Display`` 控制 320 x 240 ILI9342 彩色 LCD 输出。"

#: ../../source/controllers/toughc5.rst:42
msgid "CHSC6540 capacitive touch input through ``M5.Touch``."
msgstr "通过 ``M5.Touch`` 使用 CHSC6540 电容式触摸输入。"

#: ../../source/controllers/toughc5.rst:43
msgid "Buzzer tone output through ``M5.Speaker``."
msgstr "通过 ``M5.Speaker`` 控制蜂鸣器音调输出。"

#: ../../source/controllers/toughc5.rst:44
msgid "RX8130 real-time clock through ``M5.Rtc``."
msgstr "通过 ``M5.Rtc`` 使用 RX8130 实时时钟。"

#: ../../source/controllers/toughc5.rst:45
msgid ""
"Battery, VBUS, charging, and external output power management through "
"``M5.Power``."
msgstr "通过 ``M5.Power`` 管理电池、VBUS、充电和外部输出电源。"

#: ../../source/controllers/toughc5.rst:46
msgid ""
"microSD card access through ``hardware.SDCard``. The SD interface uses "
"SPI pins GPIO9 (SCK), GPIO7 (MOSI), GPIO8 (MISO), and GPIO10 (CS)."
msgstr ""
"通过 ``hardware.SDCard`` 访问 microSD 卡。SD 接口使用 SPI 引脚 "
"GPIO9（SCK）、GPIO7（MOSI）、GPIO8（MISO）和 GPIO10（CS）。"

#: ../../source/controllers/toughc5.rst:48
msgid ""
"Port A I2C through ``M5.Ex_I2C``. Port A uses GPIO3 (SCL) and GPIO2 (SDA)"
" and shares the internal I2C bus."
msgstr ""
"通过 ``M5.Ex_I2C`` 使用 Port A I2C。Port A 使用 GPIO3（SCL）和 GPIO2（SDA），并与内部 I2C "
"总线共享。"

#: ../../source/controllers/toughc5.rst:50
msgid "Port B GPIO on GPIO1 and GPIO6, and Port C GPIO on GPIO12 and GPIO11."
msgstr "Port B GPIO 使用 GPIO1 和 GPIO6，Port C GPIO 使用 GPIO12 和 GPIO11。"

#~ msgid "M5Stack ToughC5"
#~ msgstr "M5Stack ToughC5"

#~ msgid "Power button input through ``M5.BtnPWR``."
#~ msgstr "通过 ``M5.BtnPWR`` 读取电源按键输入。"

